    "stage1_association": "pooled rank AUC, z = |AUC-0.5|/SE (Hanley-McNeil); null = permuted labels; B = 20000; BH at 0.05 across all 474 surviving sensors",
    "stage2_invariance": "Cochran's Q of within-block AUCs about their inverse-variance mean; null = rows reshuffled into same-sized blocks, which holds each sensor's pooled association fixed and destroys only the block structure; B = 20000; BH at 0.05 within stage 1's survivors",
